---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components

This repository builds on the GGPP release:

  Prompt-Perturbation-in-Retrieval-Augmented-Generation
  https://github.com/Hadise-zb/Prompt-Perturbation-in-Retrieval-Augmented-Generation

That release ships no licence file, so its code is not redistributed here. The two
files this package imports from it are generated locally instead:

  DGD/DGD.py             byte-identical upstream copy, used as the "original" arm
  DGD/help_functions.py  upstream file plus a switchable query-wrapper parameter

Run `python tools/fetch_upstream.py` to obtain them from the upstream repository.
Both paths are git-ignored and are never committed. If you use them, cite the
original paper (see CITATION.cff); their copyright remains with the upstream authors.

Everything else in this repository is this project's own work and falls under the
MIT licence above.
